Package: bever
Title: Read BEVE Draws Files from an Experimental CmdStan Fork
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Maximilian", "Scholz", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dev.scholz@mailbox.org")
Description: Reads the BEVE (Binary Efficient Versatile Encoding) files of
    posterior draws that revision 64659d8 of the experimental 'sims1253/cmdstan'
    fork wrote, into a matrix. Later revisions of the fork do not write this
    format, and no released 'CmdStan' writes it.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.96.1
Config/rextendr/version: 0.4.2
NeedsCompilation: yes
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
